      "mergeID": "6001e73a8edb6059eb7b87f3",
      "mergedPostDetails": "It used to be that you will only need to log in once per the browser launch (so you could have the authorization persist for weeks if you don't turn off your machine). Now though you can have the browser open all day and will still be asked to log in again, which is very annoying.\nSeems like this started after the NYE. Client exhibits the same behaviour, but that's a separate canny\nMy IP is static, so that shouldn't be an issue, and others reported similar issues",
      "mergedPostTitle": "VRC Website loses authorization multiple times per day",
