  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It used to be that you will only need to log in once every couple weeks or so, or even months. Now I'm being asked to log into the client every other launch (multiple times per day even). Which is very annoying to do in VR, so I just have to start the client in desktop first before going into VR just to log in easier.\nSeems like this started after the NYE. Website exhibits a similar behaviour.\nMy IP is static, so that shouldn't be an issue, and others reported similar issues",
